@PaulCrumpler: Still haven't seen the film. But having seen the posters and marketing, the film looks like a ripoff of Spiderman - so I don't know if I'll bother watching.
For me however, the most exciting (and saddest) part of the story is how much talent Gulshan Kumar was able to assemble. Most of these singers were unknown when Kumar signed them. So many of the singers were able to go from singing in low-profile films to more famous roles in films like Devdas, Rangeela, Kaho Na Pyaar Hai
